      "title": "Verifier policy: V2-7, V2-9, V2-10 and V2-12 under exact policies and modes (verifier_policy_vectors.json)",
      "claim": "Each case runs under its exact policy and verification_time. Hybrid positives verify under each requested mode; a present and invalid PQ signature of the bundle, the passport or a checkpoint is rejected (verified false) in every mode; a policy whose accepted_classical_algs, accepted_pq_algs or advisory_rejected_algs excludes an algorithm the bundle uses rejects it; committed classical-only bundles whose tier demands hybrid_required are rejected under a requested classical_only or hybrid_preferred mode. Every negative counts only if its positive control passed in the same run.",
      "limits": [
        "Opt-in: it does not change the default catalog (/1, 38 cases), the evidence catalog (/2, 241 cases), the admission catalog (/3, 140 cases) or the schema-closure diagnostic.",
        "Requested mode: default_mode and every risk_overrides entry of the case policy. The tier and the effective mode recorded with each case are derived from the signed intent and policy decision (DCP-AI-v2.0.md § 14.2, VERIFICATION.md V2-9) for the reader; contract /2 judges the verdict only and never compares a resolved tier or mode reported by an implementation.",
        "Effective classical_only is reached only by routine_hybrid, a bundle generated for this suite with the committed TEST-ONLY keys; the committed standard bundle raises a requested classical_only to hybrid_preferred.",
        "Not in this suite: a classical exclusion (accepted_classical_algs or advisory_rejected_algs) under pq_only, kept in the corpus as omitted (question Q1), an invalid classical component under pq_only (Q2) and lists on an absent PQ component (Q3). The dated clarification of VERIFICATION.md V2-10 (05/11/2026) settles all three; external.v2.verifier_policy_clarification runs them.",
        "A negative counts only if its control passed: the same bundle under the same requested mode without the change, or, for the tier cases, the committed classical-only routine bundle under that mode, a per-mode control and not a single-change twin. Rejection messages are not judged."
      ],
